      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> <strong>Shapechanger:</strong> Magic action, shape-shift into a Beast, Humanoid or Monstrosity of CR 10 or lower for 1 hour - choose it in the dialog. You keep your mental scores, Hit Points, type, class features and spellcasting, and gain Temporary Hit Points equal to the form's Hit Points + 20 (Hardy Transformation). Once per Long Rest. It ends early when the Temporary Hit Points are gone or you revert (by hand).</p>",
